<title>USA: CoCensys names Nichol president, CEO.</title>
<headline>CoCensys names Nichol president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CoCensys Inc said Tuesday it had named F. Richard Nichol as president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>It did not say when the appointment was effective and did not name his predecessor.</p>
<p>Officials at the company were not available for comment.</p>
<p>Nichol, 54, was formerly president, chief executive and chairman of the clinical research company IBRD-Rostrum Global Inc. Prior to that he was a senior research scientist at Upjohn, according to CoCensys.</p>
